    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Harmony Initiate.</strong> You are a designated Harmony asset for your Domain.</p><ul><li>You gain a skill rank in <strong>Diplomacy (Presence)</strong> and <strong>Insight (Soul)</strong> (handled by the Harmony Marshal class traits).</li><li>When you are the active Harmony Marshal for a Domain, that Domain’s <strong>Soft Power generation increases by 10%</strong> (rounding in your favor). The GM can apply this as a +10% modifier or as a small bonus whenever it would meaningfully matter for the current campaign scale.</li><li>This feature is Bad Eden-only and interacts with your Domain sheet’s Soft Power channel.</li></ul>",
